ally the highest general officer rank in the modern forces.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 11:41:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Dollar General</title><link>https://www.dollargeneral.com/</link><description>Dollar General makes it easier to shop for everyday needs by offering the most popular brands at low everyday prices in convenient locations and online.</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 22:55:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>GENERAL | English meaning - Cambridge Dictionary</title><link>https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/general</link><description>GENERAL definition: 1. involving or relating to most or all people, things, or places, especially when these are…. Learn more.</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 08:10:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>General - Definition, Meaning &amp; Synonyms | Vocabulary.com</title><link>https://www.vocabulary.com/dictionary/general</link><description>General comes from the French word générale, which means "common to all people," but we use it for more than just people. You might inquire about the general habits of schoolchildren, or the general temperature at night in the desert.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:24:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>GENERAL Definition &amp; Meaning | Dictionary.com</title><link>https://www.dictionary.com/browse/general</link><description>GENERAL definition: of or relating to all persons or things belonging to a group or category. See examples of general used in a sentence.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:38:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>The General Auto Insurance</title><link>https://www.thegeneral.com/mypolicy/welcome.htm</link><description>No sign in required. With The General ® App. Download It Today!</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:37:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Get the Best Deals &amp; Savings - Dollar General Weekly Ad</title><link>https://www.dollargeneral.com/deals/weekly-ads</link><description>Dollar G